  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたちでユニットを組むってこと！？\r\nそうだよねっ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういうことだ\r\nこれからは３人で、アイドルとして頑張ってもらいたい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お披露目に、デビューライブも予定している\r\n……やってくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私が、お客さんたちの前で歌う……\r\nほわぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろんだよ！　よろしくね、プロデューサー！\r\nそれに──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、ごめん！　自己紹介からしなきゃだよね！\r\nわたし、八宮めぐる！　ふたりは？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "さ、櫻木真乃です\r\nよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……風野灯織です\r\nよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "真乃と、灯織だね！\r\nこちらこそよろしくだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "って、急にごめん！\r\nふたりのこと、名前で呼んでもいいかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、もう呼んじゃったんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ。もちろん、大丈夫だよ\r\n私も、めぐるちゃんって呼んでもいいかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！\r\n灯織──ちゃんはどう？　名前で呼んでもいい？",
