    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010270"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やったぁ、ありがとう！\r\nじゃあ、まずはわたしからいくね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしは、ちょっと前から２８３プロで\r\nお世話になってるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "灯織とは、レッスンでも何度か会ってるよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうだね。……何度か見かけてると思う\r\n八宮さんとユニットを組むとは思ってなかったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　だからすっごく嬉しいし、今からが楽しみ！\r\nわたしたち、仲間になったんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ね、真乃は？　どうしてアイドルになったの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010340,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "わ、私は……\r\nプロデューサーさんに、スカウトしてもらって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうなんだー！？　スカウトってかっこいいね！\r\n真乃に会って、プロデューサーはビビッと来ちゃったんだね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010350"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010360,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ。そ、そんな……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001010370,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと、めぐるちゃんと灯織ちゃんは、\r\nもうレッスン始めてるんだよね？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100101/4001001010370"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "hiori"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
